// Alert 的具名分组视觉由 UIX 唯一拥有；Rust 内核负责内容、状态语义、输入、关闭生命周期和绘制执行。
<Visual
  name="ALERT_DEFAULTS_VISUAL"
  type="AlertDefaultsVisual"
  width={300.0}
  baseHeight={36.0}
  descriptionHeight={18.0}
  showIcon={true}
  banner={false}
/>

<Visual
  name="ALERT_LAYOUT_VISUAL"
  type="AlertLayoutVisual"
  closeWidth={36.0}
  closeActionGap={4.0}
  contentRightGap={8.0}
  actionWidth={64.0}
  actionContentGap={8.0}
  iconMaxWidth={28.0}
  iconGap={8.0}
  noIconLeft={14.0}
  contentVerticalInset={4.0}
  contentVerticalRatio={0.5}
  messageHeightRatio={0.52}
  accentX={2.0}
  accentY={4.0}
  accentWidth={3.0}
  iconX={8.0}
/>

<Visual
  name="ALERT_CHROME_VISUAL"
  type="AlertChromeVisual"
  accentRadius={1.5}
  actionInset={3.0}
  closeInset={4.0}
  focusStroke={2.0}
  containerRadius={alert_radius_normal()}
  interactionRadius={alert_radius_small()}
/>

<Visual
  name="ALERT_TYPOGRAPHY_VISUAL"
  type="AlertTypographyVisual"
  message={14.0}
  description={12.0}
  action={13.0}
  statusIcon={14.0}
  closeIcon={14.0}
  successIcon="check-circle"
  infoIcon="info"
  warningIcon="alert-triangle"
  errorIcon="x-circle"
  closeIconName="x"
/>

<Visual
  name="ALERT_SUCCESS_PALETTE_VISUAL"
  type="AlertStatusPaletteVisual"
  background={alert_success_bg()}
  foreground={alert_success()}
/>

<Visual
  name="ALERT_INFO_PALETTE_VISUAL"
  type="AlertStatusPaletteVisual"
  background={alert_info_bg()}
  foreground={alert_info()}
/>

<Visual
  name="ALERT_WARNING_PALETTE_VISUAL"
  type="AlertStatusPaletteVisual"
  background={alert_warning_bg()}
  foreground={alert_warning()}
/>

<Visual
  name="ALERT_ERROR_PALETTE_VISUAL"
  type="AlertStatusPaletteVisual"
  background={alert_error_bg()}
  foreground={alert_error()}
/>

<Visual
  name="ALERT_PALETTE_VISUAL"
  type="AlertPaletteVisual"
  statuses={[
    ALERT_SUCCESS_PALETTE_VISUAL,
    ALERT_INFO_PALETTE_VISUAL,
    ALERT_WARNING_PALETTE_VISUAL,
    ALERT_ERROR_PALETTE_VISUAL
  ]}
  text={alert_text()}
  textSecondary={alert_text_secondary()}
  fillSecondary={alert_fill_secondary()}
  fillTertiary={alert_fill_tertiary()}
  primary={alert_primary()}
/>

<Visual
  name="ALERT_VISUAL"
  type="AlertVisual"
  defaults={ALERT_DEFAULTS_VISUAL}
  layout={ALERT_LAYOUT_VISUAL}
  chrome={ALERT_CHROME_VISUAL}
  typography={ALERT_TYPOGRAPHY_VISUAL}
  palette={ALERT_PALETTE_VISUAL}
/>

<KernelView value={build_alert_view(kernel, ALERT_VISUAL_REF)} />
